lse,"captionSecondary":false,"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNDc=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Obsidian-Final-26.02.26-116-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnQAAABXRUJQVlA4IGgAAAAwAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJYwC7AYv/qhxquokAADib7oR3aKEkR06OtRYN1XpuZ5nmeoWDwCL3BRV6hqZ8+mzKdu74t96DDbLVweQ7WwswPqxBaV9KfX37OvYwcV/q4BjyRPpHsKZN2QAAA=="},"imageSecondary":{"id":"cG9zdDoyODk=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Obsidian-Final-26.02.26-44-scaled-1.jpg","width":2666,"height":4000,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRowAAABXRUJQVlA4IIAAAAAQBACdASoQABgAPu1kqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JZwDDNCHo5kWPigcnH7RLQgD9LDCg6Ig5D3/QgulzOZdz+iy1o7u5jsr/QSoWauuvFPIkQgveCbbg9fw3FkzheVikQAuHuJX51zyGv3QUR7+1Z06T+85m1mRZkgJEiBmztMa7z7AAAA=="},"video":null,"videoSecondary":null},{"type":"section-intro","heading":"In collaboration","subheading":"Philosophy","content":"<p>Obsidian embraces a strong architectural language, where scale, proportion and materiality are carefully controlled to achieve a cohesive and enduring outcome. Through detailed coordination and a shared commitment to quality, the design balances expressive intent with practical execution, resulting in a residence that feels both bold and meticulously considered.</p>\n","cta":false,"image":null,"video":null},{"type":"image-three-column","images":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoxNzM=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Image_3-1-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":3200,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlIAAABXRUJQVlA4IEYAAAAQAgCdASoQAA0AA4BaJZQCdAELz7Q6RYAAAP7139YY96wMBN1/P9+SYEPF6a5KjySV0gjUeF+4ryPg9G/9ao1p7zlnlAAA"},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNjc=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-collaborators-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2667,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnQAAABXRUJQVlA4IGgAAAAQAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJQBOgMYO2DQpwSwAAP7YePSOCCWbMJU0l/K/sHO8j9h5tO//bNerVZcj/o5zYJL5FfmNcdbsgrdf03jsTknI2I38YU9wB7lEDzMLPnsYak2x8/MKQvmv9cAAAA=="},"video":false},{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNzU=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/wet-areas-17-1-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkoAAABXRUJQVlA4ID4AAADQAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZQC7AC6vmrYAAD+UwDbdeqUtRyjlv588MArfAY8AL11HBh6NzLU/KcVGADhCQAAAA=="},"video":false}]},{"type":"list-carousel","heading":"Project Highlights","description":"Designed as a bold, family-oriented residence, Obsidian combines strong architectural form with expansive, functional living spaces. Large-scale glazing, including a 9.6-metre stacker door and a dramatic skylit entry, draws natural light throughout the home while reinforcing the connection between interior and exterior. Rich, contrasting materials such as Tundra Grey stone and dark timber detailing define the façade, softened by landscape elements. Internally, generous bedrooms, multiple work-from-home spaces, and a highly detailed joinery package support modern living, while integrated lighting and carefully selected finishes enhance both atmosphere and durability.","panels":[{"image":{"id":"cG9zdDoyOTA=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Obsidian-Final-26.02.26-7-scaled-1.jpg","width":2666,"height":4000,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRpwAAABXRUJQVlA4IJAAAAAwBACdASoQABgAPu1iqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JaQAD5dF7CfvsYwKcqXTFnAAA/mxp01J9svIX6nBmDpb8b7kLM/RsChbrTGlnmMy4in/vQj0yl+gfzDtv8uLF/Ur3DcnHZ7F05LPvaewo6eQ8VJX+hEoEfG3Q0TKQkVNGh/eK8Oo7x9wAzJ/gAfRExf9Vlq8cAAA="},"description":false}],"list":[{"label":false,"value":false}]}],"pageData":{"title":"Obsidian","parents":[],"featuredImage":false,"colorTheme":"light","projectData":{"heading":"A curated design crafted alongside Locus Design Group for a residence that expresses bold architectural presence in it’s scale and refined  materiality.","content":"<p>Obsidian was shaped by a vision for a bold, expressive home that reflects the personality and lifestyle of its occupants. The design prioritises expansive, open living with a strong connection between indoor and outdoor spaces, while maintaining a high level of functionality and durability. A considered approach to material selection, spatial planning and lighting ensures the home supports both everyday living and large-scale entertaining, creating an environment that is both striking and highly liveable.</p>\n","mainImage":{"id":"cG9zdDoyNDU=","alt":"","caption":"","sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Obsidian-Final-26.02.26-89-scaled-1.jpg","width":4000,"height":2666,"blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmgAAABXRUJQVlA4IFwAAADwAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZQCdAEOvxK7ogAA/mjHdiBrx1rKdx0ROba5TeeTTE/QHTPIvc/k8mJZ7+KZHuEXgmF7W3ojU4KCWhQT8sesci6RfESOHxdjynTshZgAAA=="},"video":{"id":"cG9zdDo2MTA=","caption":"","url":"https://vz-a28667fb-df9.b-cdn.net/530c99f8-68bf-454e-b2d2-a2069e2c6a2c/playlist.m3u8","width":2560,"height":1440},"details":[{"label":"Name","value":"Obsidian"},{"label":"Status","value":"Completed 2025"},{"label":"Location","value":"Essendon, Melbourne"},{"label":"Architect","value":"Locus Design Group"}],"nextPost":{"heading":"Ascot Residence","description":false,"label":"2019","link":{"target":false,"title":"Ascot Residence","url":"/projects/ascot-residence/"},"image":{"sourceUrl":"https://haven.api.jtbadev.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/11_Harmony_Road_2-1-scaled-1.jpg","alt":"","width":"4000","height":"2666","blurPlaceholder":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlwAAABXRUJQVlA4IFAAAAAwAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJYwC7AEQaHA9F0JxgAD+6Ft1BRfIibQgHYXBL42uuQLYtS3O3K+2W6ci74xrffPj1+Zz6rdCHWSAmd2iUiv8QDaAAA=="},"videoUrl":false}}},"postType":"Project"}}}